      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 18, from about 19:30 I was at the Drover's Rest; home around 21:15 and to bed; on Day 19 at the square from about 07:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
      "time": 25643,
