      ],
      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Drover's Rest, from about 18:00 to 21:00 on Day 18, I saw Agnes, Greta, Hedda, Ida, Margaret, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Agnes, Margaret and Viktor were the worse for drink.",
