      "key": "K0170",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 18: from about 19:30 to 23:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 23:16 I passed through the square; from about 23:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 25643,
      "topics": [
