      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Drover's Rest, from about 17:00 to 23:00 on Day 18, I saw Agnes, Emil, Greta, Ida, Margaret, Tomas and Viktor, coming and going; Agnes, Emil, Margaret and Viktor were the worse for drink.",
