      "key": "K0397",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 18: from about 19:30 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 25643,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "agnes",
       "greta"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0398",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Agnes told me there's bad blood between them and Greta \u2014 a quarrel over a boundary fence.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
