      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 18, from about 19:30 I was at the Drover's Rest; along Mill Road around 22:15; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; home around 22:15 and to bed.",
      "time": 25643,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "tomas"
      ],
