      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Drover's Rest, from about 18:00 to 22:00 on Day 18, I saw Agnes, Emil, Greta, Hedda, Ida, Margaret and Tomas, coming and going; Agnes and Emil were the worse for drink.",
